---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<SiteLayout title="About the Creative Studio" description="Meet The Odd Phoenix, an independent studio combining journalism, graphic design, professional communication, and visual storytelling."><PageHeader eyebrow="THE STUDIO" title="ABOUT THE ODD PHOENIX" description="An independent multidisciplinary studio helping businesses and organizations communicate with clarity, purpose, and personality."/><section class="wrap about-grid section"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</p><h2>OUR APPROACH</h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">Creative work should help people understand you.</p><p>The Odd Phoenix serves small businesses, entrepreneurs, nonprofits, and community organizations through effective writing, thoughtful design, and compelling visual content.</p><p>We begin by listening. Clear communication, accessibility, inclusivity, and community connections shape practical solutions suited to each project.</p><Button href={`${base}services/`}>Explore services</Button></div></section><section class="about section"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">PROFESSIONAL FOUNDATION</p><h2>PROFESSIONAL BACKGROUND</h2></div><div><p>The founder brings nearly eight years of combined U.S. Army Public Affairs experience across journalism, photography, multimedia production, digital communications, and community relations.</p><p>That background includes more than 150 published news and feature articles, and content development for the Show Me Fort Leonard Wood WordPress blog, which reached more than 200,000 readers.</p><p>Photography recognition includes Army Materiel Command, Installation Management Command, and Department of the Army-level recognition.</p><p>Experience in graphic design, writing, editing, WordPress, website content, and SEO supports an approach that connects the message with the way it is presented.</p><Button href={`${base}contact/`}>Discuss your project</Button></div></div></section></SiteLayout>
